    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛡️ PHASE 2B: PLAN APPROVAL & REVISION INITIALIZER\n\n### 📌 OVERVIEW\nIntelligent triage engine triggered by the **Master Router** via `Execute Workflow Trigger`. Captures inline interactive button data (`APPROVE` or `REVISE`), applies strict role-based access control, forks the execution logic into two operational paths, and establishes interactive session states.\n\n---\n\n### 🗺️ ARCHITECTURAL FLOW & BLOCKS\n\n#### 🛡️ 1. Authentication Check & Intake\n- **Trigger Ingestion:** Accepts incoming Telegram payloads containing context-specific string expressions.\n- **Callback Parsing:** Splices incoming data blocks using vertical bars (`|`) to isolate structural variables (`action`, `client_id`).\n- **RBAC Security Gate:** Queries `Authorized_Users` to verify if the clicking user has active `Admin` or `Strategist` properties. Unauthorized clicks trigger immediate routing kills via a `Stop and Error` node.\n\n#### 🔀 2. Routing Logic Fork\n- **Acknowledge:** Dispatches a clean fallback call to flush the Telegram keyboard loader layout instantly.\n- **Conditional Branching:** Evaluates the extracted variable parameters to fork execution streams:\n  • `action == APPROVE` ➡️ Route to the **Approval Pipeline**\n  • `action == REVISE` ➡️ Route to the **Revision Initializer Pipeline**\n\n#### ✅ 3. Production Approval Path\n- **Supabase Sync Loop:** Modifies target `Content_Calendar` structures to set day statuses to `Plan_Approved`. Sets project tables on the `Clients` record to match the approved milestone.\n- **Workspace Compilation:** Fetches the spreadsheet ID, maps key values across explicit schemas, and programmatically locks corresponding cells in Google Sheets to `Plan_Approved`.\n- **Handoff:** Aggregates background loop sequences and fires a confirmation string to Telegram signaling the initialization of the Production phases.\n\n#### ✏️ 4. State Machine Revision Path\n- **User Prompting:** Dispatches an immediate Markdown prompt via Telegram requesting granular day references and formatting instructions.\n- **Database Progression:** Shifts status metrics on both `Clients` and all `Content_Calendar` day rows to `Revision_Requested`.\n- **Session Locking (The Fix):** Injects a fresh data record containing the `telegram_id` and target `client_id` directly into the `Pending_Revisions` lookup table. This locks the admin into an active session state, safely priming the system to capture their upcoming plain-text reply text.",
        "height": 1808,
        "width": 3616,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1392,
        -1024
      ],
      "id": "50466046-c388-4987-9124-bc1aab214157",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
